WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:08.950
An invoice for EUR 12,480 is linked to an order for EUR 1,248.
The workflow pauses before payment preparation.

00:08.950 --> 00:17.900
A read-only test compares PO-731 with proposed order PO-732.
Supplier, currency, total and line items match. Payment actions are skipped.

00:17.900 --> 00:26.850
Finance reviews a specific submitted version and its test.
A decision requires a note and acknowledgement of the evidence.

00:26.850 --> 00:35.800
This example retains returned v1 and approved v2 with separate test IDs.
Approving the correction does not execute a payment.

00:35.800 --> 00:45.000
An ERP update makes the earlier evidence outdated.
The historical snapshot remains, but a fresh test and review are required.
